│                          │ with parameterized CRZ gates. This preserves the overall circuit depth and connectivity   │
│                          │ pattern while introducing tunable entanglement strength at alternating positions, similar │
│                          │ to the successful sparse parameterized approach from Gen 8 that achieved a low            │
│                          │ generalization gap (~0.04). This adds only 3 new parameters while potentially improving   │
│                          │ the circuit's ability to learn task-relevant correlations, without significantly          │
│                          │ increasing parameter count or depth compared to the fully fixed CZ chain.                 │
