│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ The current ansatz entangles nearest neighbors (distance 1, "ring") and distance-2        │
│                          │ ("skip") pairs, but never connects qubits that are maximally separated on the 8-qubit     │
│                          │ ring (distance 4, "diameter": pairs (0,4),(1,5),(2,6),(3,7)). Adding these long-range     │
│                          │ links lets information mix across the whole register in a single layer, which is known to │
│                          │ improve expressivity and trainability of shallow hardware-efficient ansätze without a     │
│                          │ large parameter cost. Following the recommendation, we split the diameter entangler into  │
│                          │ two shared parameters based on even/odd starting qubit ("crz_diam_even" for [0,4] and     │
│                          │ [2,6], "crz_diam_odd" for [1,5] and [3,7]") rather than one single parameter, giving the  │
│                          │ circuit more flexibility to learn different global-mixing angles for the two interleaved  │
│                          │ antipodal pairs while only adding 2 parameters total. This keeps parameter count low and  │
│                          │ efficient while adding a new topological feature (full-diameter connectivity) that the    │
│                          │ current spec lacks, which should help close the generalization gap and improve            │
│                          │ validation/test accuracy by allowing richer global correlations to be captured.           │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0541                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 4; deleted: 0; modified: 0;                                                        │
