│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Builds on the previous best-performing tied-duplication ansatz (0.89 score) by adding a   │
│                          │ diameter-distance entangling layer (distance-4 CRZ connections with a single shared       │
│                          │ parameter) after the existing skip-2 layer. This introduces long-range (opposite-qubit)   │
│                          │ correlations that were previously missing, while keeping parameter growth minimal (only 1 │
│                          │ new shared parameter per block). The full block — RY pre-rotation, alternating-shared     │
│                          │ ring CRZ, RX rotation, shared skip-2 CRZ, and now shared diameter CRZ — is then           │
│                          │ duplicated with fully tied parameter names (as in the best prior candidate), doubling     │
│                          │ effective depth without increasing parameter count beyond the single extra diameter       │
│                          │ parameter. This tests whether adding a genuinely all-to-all-reachable connectivity        │
│                          │ pattern (ring + skip-2 + skip-4 gives every qubit pair reachable within 2 hops) improves  │
│                          │ validation accuracy and reduces the generalization gap relative to the 0.89 baseline,     │
│                          │ while still using very few unique parameters (20 per block) for efficient training and    │
│                          │ fast convergence.                                                                         │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0617                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 9; deleted: 0; modified: 1;                                                        │
