│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ none                                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Building on the Gen35 hierarchical block (RY → alternating ring CRZ → RX → skip-2 CRZ →   │
│                          │ diameter CRZ), the key insight is that the two-parameter alternating diameter layer added │
│                          │ expressivity but also slowed convergence (540 steps) relative to the simpler skip-only    │
│                          │ variant (150 steps, but worse gap). To get the best of both worlds, this version (1)      │
│                          │ collapses the diameter layer to a *single* shared parameter (`crz_diam`) instead of two   │
│                          │ alternating ones, cutting one knob that mainly added training-time variance without much  │
│                          │ added expressivity, and (2) introduces a new distance-3 ("skip-3") entangling layer with  │
│                          │ a single shared parameter (`crz_skip3`) to cover the previously-missing connectivity      │
│                          │ pattern (0-3,1-4,...) at minimal parameter cost. The block (RY, ring-CRZ alternating, RX, │
│                          │ skip-2 CRZ, skip-3 CRZ, diameter CRZ) is applied twice with shared parameter names,       │
│                          │ preserving the proven "shared-depth" regularization trick while giving richer global      │
│                          │ connectivity (skip-2, skip-3, and diameter cover distances 2, 3, and 4) at a lower total  │
│                          │ parameter count than Gen35, aiming for a better accuracy/gap/convergence trade-off.       │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0527                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
