│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ modular_block_with_partial_ring_desharing                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ The current flat single-block ansatz (score 0.86) underperforms the earlier modular       │
│                          │ two-block design (score 0.89) that used per-qubit RY, alternating-shared ring CRZ, RX     │
│                          │ layer, skip-2/skip-3 CRZ, and single-parameter diameter CRZ, repeated twice with fully    │
│                          │ shared parameters. Reverting to that stronger modular structure recovers the higher score │
│                          │ baseline. On top of that, I apply the recommended targeted tweak: partially de-share the  │
│                          │ ring CRZ parameters across the two block repetitions (block 0 gets its own                │
│                          │ "crz_ring_even_b0"/"crz_ring_odd_b0", block 1 keeps the original                          │
│                          │ "crz_ring_even"/"crz_ring_odd"), while keeping skip-2, skip-3, and diameter parameters    │
│                          │ fully shared across both blocks. This adds only 2 extra parameters but gives the first    │
│                          │ entangling layer block-specific flexibility, which may help the circuit build a more      │
│                          │ useful initial local-correlation structure before the shared mid/long-range mixing        │
│                          │ layers, without sacrificing the parameter-sharing stability benefits that drove the       │
│                          │ previous good result.                                                                     │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0537                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-5                                                      │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 21; deleted: 0; modified: 43;                                                      │
